# Generated geometry and provenance
geometry/processed/
geometry/validated_*/

# Small, immutable provenance for the geometry used by the published CFD fit.
# The 61 MB selected STL and 586 MB repaired OBJ stay out of Git; these JSON
# records contain their hashes, dimensions, repair parameters, and audits.
!geometry/validated_locked_rotor_v1/
geometry/validated_locked_rotor_v1/*
!geometry/validated_locked_rotor_v1/selection_report.json
!geometry/validated_locked_rotor_v1/wetted_body_m.json

