.runtime/

# Generated OpenFOAM cases and meshes
cases/
cases_*/
mesh_case/constant/polyMesh/
mesh_case/[1-9]*/
mesh_case/postProcessing/
mesh_case/processor*/
**/processor*/
**/postProcessing/
**/log.*

